{"file": "宝星行-第109集.mp4", "ep": 109, "duration": 51.0, "segments": [{"start": 0.69, "end": 3.94, "text": "人人有份 別搶"}, {"start": 3.94, "end": 5.94, "text": "原來大象也是個吃貨"}, {"start": 5.94, "end": 7.94, "text": "給足甜頭就老實了"}, {"start": 7.94, "end": 8.94, "text": "以後懸崖下的試驗田"}, {"start": 8.94, "end": 10.94, "text": "總算安全了"}, {"start": 10.94, "end": 12.94, "text": "照片和羅胖辦事效率還挺高"}, {"start": 12.94, "end": 13.94, "text": "車子買得何用"}, {"start": 13.94, "end": 19.5, "text": "回天羅一號"}, {"start": 19.5, "end": 21.33, "text": "通哥"}, {"start": 21.33, "end": 22.33, "text": "歡迎晚載而歸啊"}, {"start": 22.33, "end": 23.33, "text": "閃一邊去"}, {"start": 23.33, "end": 24.33, "text": "一身臭汗"}, {"start": 24.33, "end": 25.33, "text": "老闆"}, {"start": 25.33, "end": 27.33, "text": "你總算回來了"}, {"start": 27.33, "end": 28.33, "text": "想死我了"}, {"start": 28.33, "end": 29.33, "text": "幾天不見"}, {"start": 29.33, "end": 31.33, "text": "便漂亮了"}, {"start": 31.33, "end": 32.33, "text": "裙子很合身"}, {"start": 32.33, "end": 33.33, "text": "有一性沒人性啊"}, {"start": 33.33, "end": 34.33, "text": "當著單身狗的面"}, {"start": 34.33, "end": 35.33, "text": "撒狗糧"}, {"start": 35.33, "end": 36.33, "text": "喪盡天良啊"}, {"start": 36.33, "end": 37.33, "text": "哎呦"}, {"start": 37.33, "end": 38.33, "text": "通哥你又收了隻寵物"}, {"start": 38.33, "end": 39.33, "text": "這小松鼠也太猛了吧"}, {"start": 39.33, "end": 40.33, "text": "來"}, {"start": 40.33, "end": 42.0, "text": "讓胖爺摸摸"}, {"start": 42.0, "end": 43.0, "text": "得"}, {"start": 43.0, "end": 44.0, "text": "連這號子都瞧不起我"}, {"start": 44.0, "end": 45.61, "text": "去"}, {"start": 45.61, "end": 46.61, "text": "黃財"}, {"start": 46.61, "end": 47.61, "text": "帶他院子裡玩去"}, {"start": 47.61, "end": 51.07, "text": "看著呢"}]}